Z||000000||Paulv||05-30-2001||10:09 PM||||As of May 29th, NIFE has sold 300 of the 600 available raffle tickets for the 88GT T-Top/$1400 Mr Mikes Interior/$500 Fiero Store Gift Certificate raffle promotion. We started selling April 21st. Tickets have been sold to enthusiasts in 26 states and Canada. Drawing will be held September 9th at NIFE's Fierorama in Oak Brook IL. Still plenty of time to purchase your ticket! With 3 great prizes, you have a 1 in 200 chance to win!  <BR>We have just posted an additional picture of the 88GT on the NIFE Raffle site....Since this car was the actual Fiero in the Pontiac display at the 1988 McCormick Place (Chicago) Auto Show, we have the actual picture of it while it was in the display. We have the original 8"x10" framed color picture that will be presented with the car to the winner!<BR>See this picture, along with a description and more pictures, plus all the raffle details, and a ticket application form at:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.FieroFocus.com/NIFERaffle.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroFocus.com/NIFERaffle.htm</A> <P>BTW, the GT will be at the Dells show this weekend.<BR><P>------------------<BR>||||reg||10
